/ Input: 6 7
/ Test 2: multiply two inputs by repeated addition (a loop with Skipcond 400)
        Input
        Store X
        Input
        Store Count
Loop,   Load Count
        Skipcond 400       / Count = 0: skip the Jump and finish
        Jump Body
        Jump Done
Body,   Load Result
        Add X
        Store Result
        Load Count
        Subt One
        Store Count
        Jump Loop
Done,   Load Result
        Output
        Halt
X,      Dec 0
Count,  Dec 0
Result, Dec 0
One,    Dec 1
